{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736692284057190430","content":"Copper enters, he sits by the banner, “I’m sorry my friends. When you needed me, I was not there. I failed you, as I failed jack. I can only hope that you will forgive me, wherever you end up.”\nHe bows his head “may the gods smile upon you, and show you grace and mercy. And take you into there arms, to a place you each deserve.”\nHe takes the banner and hangs it, not wanting it to be on the floor. “May we all remember the sacrifice you made.”\nHe stands and leaves","created_at":"2020-07-31T10:00:11.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738697511585316864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
